<title>NETHERLANDS: Heidemij sees further growth.</title>
<headline>Heidemij sees further growth.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering consultancy Heidemij NV said on Tuesday it expected its activities to grow further in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The range of activities and their international spread offer good possibilities for further development of the company. Based on this, Heidemij foresees further growth of the company,&quot; Heidemij said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company earlier posted 1996 lower net profit of 26.1 million guilders, but turnover increased to 1.09 billion guilders from a year-earlier 900.4 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
